"Search for helpdesk tickets (model_name: helpdesk.ticket), retrieve the most "
"recent 5 tickets and summarize what they complain about (field_name: "
"description).\n"
"Include the ticket name (field_name: name) in the response. Don't mention "
"model_name or field_name or any record ids in the response."
msgstr ""
"Cerca i ticket dell'helpdesk (model_name: helpdesk.ticket), recupera i 5 "
"ticket più recenti e riassumi l'oggetto dei reclami (field_name: "
"description).\n"
"Includi il nome del ticket (field_name: name) nella risposta. Non menzionare "
"model_name o field_name né alcun ID di record nella risposta."

